<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>Normain — Network Diagram</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --azure:#0078d4; --azure-dim:#2b88d8; --rg:#5a9bd4;
    --vnet:#2e7d32; --subnet:#b59f3b; --net:#c0392b;
    --ink:#1b2733; --muted:#5b6b7b; --line:#34495e;
    --bg:#f4f7fb; --card:#ffffff;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  body{
    margin:0; background:var(--bg); color:var(--ink);
    font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
    line-height:1.45;
  }
  .wrap{max-width:1160px; margin:0 auto; padding:28px 24px 56px}
  header.report{
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0078d4,#005a9e);
    color:#fff; border-radius:14px; padding:24px 28px;
    box-shadow:0 6px 22px rgba(0,90,160,.18);
  }
  header.report h1{margin:0 0 4px; font-size:26px; letter-spacing:.2px}
  header.report .sub{opacity:.92; font-size:14px}
  .meta{
    display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:18px 34px; margin-top:16px;
    font-size:13px;
  }
  .meta div span{display:block; opacity:.75; font-size:11px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.6px}
  .meta div b{font-weight:600; font-size:14px}
  .card{
    background:var(--card); border:1px solid #e3eaf2; border-radius:14px;
    padding:20px; margin-top:22px; box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(20,50,80,.05);
  }
  .card h2{margin:0 0 14px; font-size:16px; color:var(--muted); font-weight:600;
    text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.7px}
  .diagram-scroll{width:100%; overflow-x:auto}
  svg{display:block; margin:0 auto; max-width:100%; height:auto}
  .legend{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(230px,1fr)); gap:14px}
  .legend .li{display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start; font-size:13px}
  .swatch{width:16px; height:16px; border-radius:4px; flex:0 0 auto; margin-top:2px; border:1.5px solid}
  .legend b{display:block; font-size:13px}
  .legend small{color:var(--muted)}
  .flowlist{margin:0; padding-left:18px; font-size:13px; color:var(--ink)}
  .flowlist li{margin:4px 0}
  .note{
    margin-top:14px; padding:12px 14px; background:#fff8e6; border:1px solid #f0dca0;
    border-radius:10px; font-size:13px; color:#6b5618;
  }
  footer{margin-top:26px; font-size:12px; color:var(--muted); text-align:center}
  code{background:#eef2f7; padding:1px 6px; border-radius:5px; font-size:12px}
  @media print{
    body{background:#fff}
    .card,header.report{box-shadow:none}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  <header class="report">
    <h1>Normain — Network Diagram</h1>
    <div class="sub">Cloud network architecture, security zones, and data flows</div>
    <div class="meta">
      <div><span>Environment</span><b>Microsoft Azure — Sweden Central</b></div>
      <div><span>Owner</span><b>Kalle Hansson</b></div>
      <div><span>Scope</span><b>Production (dev &amp; demo identical)</b></div>
      <div><span>Document date</span><b>2026-06-12</b></div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="card">
    <h2>Network Architecture</h2>
    <div class="diagram-scroll">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 1100 720" role="img" aria-label="Normain Azure network diagram">
        <defs>
          <marker id="arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
            <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" fill="#34495e"/>
          </marker>
          <style>
            .zlabel{font:600 13px -apple-system,"Segoe UI",Arial,sans-serif}
            .clabel{font:600 13px -apple-system,"Segoe UI",Arial,sans-serif; fill:#1b2733}
            .csub{font:400 11px -apple-system,"Segoe UI",Arial,sans-serif; fill:#5b6b7b}
            .flow{fill:none; stroke:#34495e; stroke-width:1.8; marker-end:url(#arrow)}
            .flbl{font:600 11px -apple-system,"Segoe UI",Arial,sans-serif; fill:#34495e}
            .flbl-bg{fill:#ffffff; opacity:.85}
          </style>
        </defs>

        <!-- ===== ZONE: Azure (Sweden Central) ===== -->
        <rect x="60" y="120" width="980" height="580" rx="12" fill="#f0f6ff" stroke="#0078d4" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text class="zlabel" x="78" y="142" fill="#0078d4">Azure (Sweden Central)</text>

        <!-- Azure subscription -->
        <rect x="90" y="158" width="920" height="528" rx="10" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#2b88d8" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="5 4"/>
        <text class="zlabel" x="106" y="178" fill="#2b88d8">Azure subscription</text>

        <!-- Resource group / Production deployment -->
        <rect x="118" y="190" width="864" height="478" rx="10" fill="#f7fbff" stroke="#5a9bd4" stroke-width="1.4"/>
        <text class="zlabel" x="134" y="210" fill="#3d7ab8">Resource group / Production deployment</text>

        <!-- Virtual network vnet-normain -->
        <rect x="148" y="222" width="804" height="404" rx="10" fill="#eef7ee" stroke="#2e7d32" stroke-width="1.6"/>
        <text class="zlabel" x="164" y="242" fill="#2e7d32">Virtual network &#8220;vnet-normain&#8221;</text>

        <!-- Subnet: snet-api -->
        <rect x="178" y="256" width="744" height="104" rx="8" fill="#fbfbe7" stroke="#b59f3b" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-dasharray="4 3"/>
        <text class="zlabel" x="192" y="274" fill="#8a771f">Subnet &#8220;snet-api-normain&#8221;</text>

        <!-- Subnet: snet-vm -->
        <rect x="178" y="372" width="744" height="104" rx="8" fill="#fbfbe7" stroke="#b59f3b" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-dasharray="4 3"/>
        <text class="zlabel" x="192" y="390" fill="#8a771f">Subnet &#8220;snet-vm-normain&#8221;</text>

        <!-- Subnet: snet-db -->
        <rect x="178" y="488" width="744" height="104" rx="8" fill="#fbfbe7" stroke="#b59f3b" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-dasharray="4 3"/>
        <text class="zlabel" x="192" y="506" fill="#8a771f">Subnet &#8220;snet-db-normain&#8221;</text>

        <!-- ===== Internet (untrusted) ===== -->
        <rect x="470" y="28" width="180" height="64" rx="10" fill="#fff3f3" stroke="#c0392b" stroke-width="1.8"/>
        <text class="clabel" x="560" y="58" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c0392b">&#127758; Internet</text>
        <text class="csub" x="560" y="76" text-anchor="middle">untrusted zone</text>

        <!-- ===== Components ===== -->
        <!-- snet-api: Load Balancer -->
        <rect x="232" y="294" width="158" height="56" rx="8" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#34495e" stroke-width="1.4"/>
        <text class="clabel" x="311" y="318" text-anchor="middle">Load Balancer</text>
        <text class="csub"   x="311" y="335" text-anchor="middle">HTTPS ingress</text>

        <!-- snet-api: API Container App -->
        <rect x="560" y="294" width="190" height="56" rx="8" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#34495e" stroke-width="1.4"/>
        <text class="clabel" x="655" y="318" text-anchor="middle">API</text>
        <text class="csub"   x="655" y="335" text-anchor="middle">[Container App]</text>

        <!-- snet-vm: Static web server -->
        <rect x="232" y="410" width="158" height="56" rx="8" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#34495e" stroke-width="1.4"/>
        <text class="clabel" x="311" y="434" text-anchor="middle">Static web server</text>
        <text class="csub"   x="311" y="451" text-anchor="middle">[VM]</text>

        <!-- snet-vm: Jump server -->
        <rect x="762" y="410" width="158" height="56" rx="8" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#34495e" stroke-width="1.4"/>
        <text class="clabel" x="841" y="434" text-anchor="middle">Jump server</text>
        <text class="csub"   x="841" y="451" text-anchor="middle">[VM] &middot; bastion</text>

        <!-- snet-db: DB -->
        <rect x="450" y="526" width="220" height="56" rx="8" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#34495e" stroke-width="1.4"/>
        <text class="clabel" x="560" y="550" text-anchor="middle">DB</text>
        <text class="csub"   x="560" y="567" text-anchor="middle">[Managed PostgreSQL]</text>

        <!-- ===== Flows ===== -->
        <!-- Internet -> Load Balancer (HTTPS) -->
        <polyline class="flow" points="560,92 560,275 311,275 311,294"/>
        <rect class="flbl-bg" x="392" y="263" width="44" height="15"/>
        <text class="flbl" x="414" y="274" text-anchor="middle">HTTPS</text>

        <!-- Internet -> Jump server (RDP) -->
        <polyline class="flow" points="610,92 610,150 980,150 980,438 920,438"/>
        <rect class="flbl-bg" x="906" y="143" width="34" height="15"/>
        <text class="flbl" x="923" y="154" text-anchor="middle">RDP</text>

        <!-- Load Balancer -> API (HTTPS) -->
        <polyline class="flow" points="390,322 560,322"/>
        <rect class="flbl-bg" x="453" y="311" width="44" height="15"/>
        <text class="flbl" x="475" y="322" text-anchor="middle">HTTPS</text>

        <!-- Load Balancer -> Static web (HTTPS) -->
        <polyline class="flow" points="311,350 311,410"/>
        <rect class="flbl-bg" x="316" y="373" width="44" height="15"/>
        <text class="flbl" x="338" y="384" text-anchor="middle">HTTPS</text>

        <!-- API -> DB (SQL) -->
        <polyline class="flow" points="655,350 655,503 540,503 540,526"/>
        <rect class="flbl-bg" x="600" y="492" width="30" height="15"/>
        <text class="flbl" x="615" y="503" text-anchor="middle">SQL</text>

        <!-- Jump server -> DB (admin) -->
        <polyline class="flow" points="841,466 841,512 600,512 600,526"/>
        <rect class="flbl-bg" x="706" y="505" width="40" height="15"/>
        <text class="flbl" x="726" y="516" text-anchor="middle">admin</text>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <div class="note">
      <b>Redundancy / multi-environment:</b> Additional resource groups with identical internal
      setups are deployed per environment (<code>dev</code>, <code>demo</code>) alongside
      <code>production</code>.
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <h2>Legend — Zones &amp; Boundaries</h2>
    <div class="legend">
      <div class="li"><span class="swatch" style="background:#fff3f3;border-color:#c0392b"></span>
        <div><b>Internet</b><small>Untrusted public zone — boundary of the environment</small></div></div>
      <div class="li"><span class="swatch" style="background:#f0f6ff;border-color:#0078d4"></span>
        <div><b>Azure (Sweden Central)</b><small>Cloud provider region — physical location</small></div></div>
      <div class="li"><span class="swatch" style="background:#eef7ee;border-color:#2e7d32"></span>
        <div><b>Virtual network &#8220;vnet-normain&#8221;</b><small>Trusted private network zone</small></div></div>
      <div class="li"><span class="swatch" style="background:#fbfbe7;border-color:#b59f3b"></span>
        <div><b>Subnets</b><small>Segmentation: api / vm / db tiers</small></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <h2>Data Flows &amp; Security Controls</h2>
    <ul class="flowlist">
      <li><b>Internet &rarr; Load Balancer</b> — public traffic terminates at the LB over <b>HTTPS</b> (TLS in transit).</li>
      <li><b>Load Balancer &rarr; API (Container App) / Static web server</b> — internal <b>HTTPS</b> within the VNet.</li>
      <li><b>API &rarr; DB</b> — application queries the managed <b>PostgreSQL</b> database (isolated <code>snet-db</code> subnet).</li>
      <li><b>Internet &rarr; Jump server</b> — administrative access via <b>RDP</b> to the bastion only; the jump server is the single controlled entry point for management.</li>
      <li><b>Jump server &rarr; DB</b> — privileged/admin database access routed through the bastion.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <footer>
    Normain network diagram &middot; recreated for the Vanta &ldquo;Network diagram&rdquo; control evidence &middot; 2026-06-12
  </footer>

</div>
</body>
</html>
